@startuml
actor User
participant "Orchestrator" as O
participant "Memory" as M
participant "Planner" as P
participant "Web Search" as W
participant "Paper Search" as PA
participant "Video Search" as V
participant "Source Verifier" as SV
participant "Synthesizer" as S
participant "Human Approval" as H
participant "Document Generator" as D

User -> O: minta deep research topik
O -> M: baca learner profile & memory
M --> O: konteks belajar
O -> P: buat subplan riset
P --> O: daftar subquery
O -> W: cari web
O -> PA: cari paper
O -> V: cari video
W --> O: hasil mentah
PA --> O: hasil mentah
V --> O: hasil mentah
O -> SV: verifikasi sumber
SV --> O: status akses & kualitas
O -> S: sintesis materi
S --> O: ringkasan + sitasi
O -> H: minta persetujuan
H --> O: disetujui / direvisi
O -> D: generate materi belajar
D --> User: dokumen + kartu recall
@enduml
